<p>Illinois House, 11th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>No campaign site found. Her office site says her legislative work has centered on environment, sustainability and clean energy policy, supporting neighborhood schools, protecting human services, preventing gun violence, state fiscal stability, reproductive rights, and data privacy; she chairs the House Executive Committee.</p>
